   "source": {
    "label": "cor:simpler-lambda-bound-local",
    "number": "Theorem (cor:simpler-lambda-bound-local)",
    "quote": "In locally observable games, it holds that $\\Lambda_\\eta^* \\leq \\max_{\\loss \\in \\Loss} \\inf_{\\bm{\\lambda} \\in \\Mloc_{\\loss}} 8 L^2 \\beta_{\\bm{\\lambda}}^2 \\min\\{\\rank(\\bm{M}),|\\supp(\\bm{\\lambda})|\\} + 2 L (1+ \\beta_{\\glo}^2) \\min\\{\\rank(\\bm{M}),w^*\\}$ provided $\\frac{1}{\\eta} \\geq 2 L (1+ \\beta_{\\glo}^2) \\min\\{\\rank(\\bm{M}),w^*\\}$"
